  "id": 203986344815274,
  "uuid": "ebeed04c-0fe0-45cb-b18a-2fe26e3ababf",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "7f22caa2-2e6e-579f-99c3-67951c26ffc6",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "295ce198-3017-eaa4-b331-8f00304a3010",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Our programme brings students from different backgrounds together to share and enjoy each other's cultures. Through fun activities and events, we create a friendly space where everyone feels included and valued.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "During the Nowruz celebration, students had a great time sharing traditions and enjoying the diversity of our community. It was a happy day filled with laughter and friendship, showing how much we appreciate each other's differences.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As we reflect on this joyous occasion, let it serve as a reminder of the importance of nurturing inclusivity and respect for all cultures within our AKU-ISMC family. Together, let us continue to cultivate an environment where diversity is celebrated, and cultural unity flourishes, enriching the fabric of our shared experience. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
